From: Aurelia contributors
Subject: Fix FFmpeg MOV status and conditional decoder builds

Return the channel-layout parser result, compile ADPCM helpers only with their decoders,
use a mutable dummy byte for the no-output LCEVC sizing pass, and omit AV1 fields
deprecated by libva 1.24 (aggregate initialization leaves them zero). No warnings are suppressed.

